From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Connor McAdams <cmcadams@codeweavers.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Jan 2026 12:30:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx11: Implement
 D3DX11CreateShaderResourceViewFrom{File,Memory,Resource}().

Signed-off-by: Connor McAdams <cmcadams@codeweavers.com>

CW-Bug-Id: #20442
CW-Bug-Id: #23084
CW-Bug-Id: #23301
(cherry picked from commit beafa01b5264998a07648a6e980535c21c30250c)
---
 dlls/d3dx11_42/d3dx11_42.spec |   8 +-
 dlls/d3dx11_43/d3dx11_43.spec |   8 +-
 dlls/d3dx11_43/tests/d3dx11.c | 446 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/d3dx11_43/texture.c      | 232 +++++++++++++++++-
 include/d3dx11tex.h           |   8 +
 5 files changed, 684 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/d3dx11_42/d3dx11_42.spec b/dlls/d3dx11_42/d3dx11_42.spec
index 2a96424e40c..0fa9cb37d51 100644
